		"description": "<p>At 18th level, your self-immolation reaches its peak, allowing you to share your pain with your enemies. When you use @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.hiNHjAoTy2gf5j9F]{Burn Bright}, you also deal 2d8 damage to each target of your cantrip. This damage is of the same type as the cantrip, but bypasses any resistance the target has. If the target is immune to this damage type, they are treated as resistant to it against your cantrip’s full damage.</p>",
